stamp-suite (1.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add current STAMP extensions, reflector admission policies and diagnostics.
  * Improve sender measurements, session management and authenticated control.
  * Harden malformed-packet handling and fix large pnet capture truncation.
  * Add Windows and macOS MTU handling and refresh release packaging checks.

 -- Piotr Olszewski <asmie@asmie.pl>  Mon, 16 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000

stamp-suite (1.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * First stable release: multi-target measurement, authenticated control API,
    kernel timestamps and updated STAMP extensions.
  * Refresh dependencies, including the Rustls security fix.
  * Include release notes, security guidance and the generated manual.
  * Install the systemd unit under /usr/lib and update Standards-Version.

 -- Piotr Olszewski <asmie@asmie.pl>  Mon, 05 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000

